  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ds_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -344
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Data story\n\nAn animated chart that tells a story year by year. The data is inline CSV (six made-up cities × eight years of daily bike trips); Partition and Lookup (`group-at`) pick the current year's row. Ranks come from two sorts (sort the cities by trips, then sort the order back: the inverse permutation), and Read* / Write* state with Lerp eases every bar's length and place a fraction of the way each frame, so bars race past each other. A ForEach sums each year for the line chart, which Trim Path reveals up to the current year; the caption for the year comes from a list and animates in letter by letter (Text Animate, timed by an Integrate that restarts whenever the year changes).\n\n• Toggle: play.  • Stepper: pick a year (with play off).  • Slider into `interval`: seconds per year.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 280
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Data story\n\nAn animated chart that tells a story year by year. The data is inline CSV (six made-up cities × eight years of daily bike trips); Partition and Lookup (`group-at`) pick the current year's row. Ranks come from two sorts (sort the cities by trips, then sort the order back: the inverse permutation), and Read* / Write* state with Lerp eases every bar's length and place a fraction of the way each frame, so bars race past each other. A ForEach sums each year for the line chart, which Trim Path reveals up to the current year; the caption for the year comes from a list and animates in letter by letter (Text Animate, timed by an Integrate that restarts whenever the year changes).\n\n• Toggle: play.  • Stepper: pick a year (with play off).  • Slider into `interval`: seconds per year.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 280
      }
    },
