    {
      "id": "ds_captions",
      "defType": "string/split",
      "position": {
        "x": 1277,
        "y": 1662
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "2018 · Cedar leads on its old river path network.|2019 · Steady growth everywhere; Aster catches Cedar.|2020 · Trips fall in every city during the shutdowns.|2021 · The rebound: Aster opens its protected lanes.|2022 · Birch adds bike share and climbs fast.|2023 · Birch takes the lead; Dune doubles in two years.|2024 · Dune's new bridge makes it the fastest riser.|2025 · Dune tops the table, ahead of Birch and Aster."
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "2018 · Cedar leads on its old river path network.|2019 · Steady growth everywhere; Aster catches Cedar.|2020 · Trips fall in every city during the shutdowns.|2021 · The rebound: Aster opens its protected lanes.|2022 · Birch adds bike share and climbs fast.|2023 · Birch takes the lead; Dune doubles in two years.|2024 · Dune's new bridge makes it the fastest riser.|2025 · Dune tops the table, ahead of Birch and Aster.",
